# Build output — reproducible byte for byte by `go build`, so it is not a document.
/bin/
*.exe
*.test
/authcore

# Go workspace overlays — local-only, and they mask a broken go.mod/go.sum pair.
go.work
go.work.sum

# Environment files — secrets, never versioned.
.env
.env.*

# The dev bench's own signing key — generated by start.sh on first run, never shared.
# prd takes a real key from its secret store; a committed one would be a credential
# every clone of this repository holds.
/devops/dev-signing-key.pem

# Local bench data directories (bind mounts, when any are added).
/devops/data/

# OS / editor noise.
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp

# NOTE — deliberately NOT ignored:
#   scaffold-service/, scaffold-entity/, omnicore-gen/
# Those hold the approved model and the per-layer plans this service was built from —
# the documents a reviewer reads to see what was decided. They are not scratch.
